title: webular
abstract: "Jev, TypeSafe's decision model, makes the judgment calls in this web research CLI. It searches, scrapes, crawls, maps, extracts, summarizes, and answers on your machine. Its plugin adds four skills: research, interview, plain language, and Markdown. Jev's key is the only key."
